sidebar: report unread transitions to the page

`unread` is a three-level enum, so a script running on the page cannot show a count.
These hooks report the transitions and leave the tally to the page; the buffer row asks
for its own number while it renders, so nothing has to observe or poll the DOM.

The `msgUnread !== Unread.NONE` guard is what keeps joins, parts and topic changes out
of the count.

